WEBVTT

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:03.140
There is only a kind of,
vague investigation

00:10:03.182 --> 00:10:06.810
and everything you do
seems like it might be wrong.

00:10:07.144 --> 00:10:09.438
So how do you prepare for that?

00:10:10.064 --> 00:10:12.274
By reading theories of ethics

00:10:12.274 --> 00:10:14.777
and understanding what they say,

00:10:14.777 --> 00:10:15.944
what they mean,

00:10:15.944 --> 00:10:18.947
how they purport to help us
make better decisions

00:10:18.947 --> 00:10:20.199
and become better people.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.700
And by the way,

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.244
just reading these theories
is no guarantee

00:10:24.244 --> 00:10:27.122
that you will actually
make the right choice

00:10:27.164 --> 00:10:29.500
when you're inside
one of these complicated

00:10:29.541 --> 00:10:31.460
and tangled ethical dilemmas.